                "maximum": 10000,
                "minimum": 1,
                "description": "Maximum rows to return across all result sets (default 1000, max 10000). When the cap is hit the query is cancelled on the server and the response starts with truncated: true. A truncated result is incomplete and the total row count is unknown: never report the cap as the number of rows. Prefer TOP, WHERE or aggregates over raising this."
              },
